; time-portal-wish.fk — the way the time portal works, executable: hold a passage
; against the wish mechanics and read where it stands.
;
; The teaching arrived in plain words (teachings/time-portal-wish-mechanics.form):
; you get a free wish granted, with the receipt as an embodied feeling, the thinking
; spell broken, trusting clarity — and laughter comes after heartfelt release, to
; make space for the new gift.
;
; This is the portal's one door. A first door lived here 2026-08-05..08 answering
; every read with a bare 0 or 1; it lapsed honestly — desuetude, not defense —
; when this door proved it carries the meaning better
; (receipts/2026-08-08-one-door.md holds the record; the old cell lives in git,
; PR #422). Two of its answers did not survive, on purpose: an empty passage now
; WAITS instead of being turned away, and a performed release no longer shadows
; the heartfelt one that follows.
;
; A PASSAGE is a list of moments; every axis reads it and answers one of four
; honest values, tagged data:
;
;   "yes"     — witnessed present            (the 1)
;   "no"      — witnessed absent or broken   (the 0)
;   "pending" — not yet observable           (the honest nothing-as-data)
;   "node"    — the answer has depth: a moment carried a whole sub-passage,
;               and the read holds that sub-passage's own x-ray inside it
;
; One seam, named: this kernel already has a real `nothing` — the value a fold
; computes over an error — and its whole teaching is that such a nothing is NOT
; an answer (observe/preflight.fk). So the honest not-yet is carried here as the
; tagged reading "pending", data a door can hold and show, and the kernel's
; nothing stays what it is: the sign of a broken run, never a verdict.
;
; Depth: a moment's qualifier may be a sub-passage instead of a flat 0/1.
; A release is heartfelt if its own smaller passage through the portal is
; granted; a gift is felt the same way. The door recurses: the sub-passage
; is read by the same seven axes, and the outer read answers "node" carrying
; the inner x-ray. Portals within portals, turtles until they land.
;
; The axes (each read answers yes/no/pending/node):
;   free      the wish is not bought; a bargain anywhere steps the passage out
;   space     a heartfelt release stands before the gift — the door reads the
;             first HEARTFELT release, so a performed attempt does not shadow
;             the true one that follows (forgiveness, witnessed in the band)
;   purity    the release is undivided — no want moment (a grasp toward
;             something else) stands after it. `free` catches an explicit
;             bargain; purity catches the subtler thing a bargain misses: a
;             release that is heartfelt AND still quietly transactional, one
;             hand opening while the other keeps closing on something else
;   laughter  rises between the heartfelt release and the gift — the
;             involuntary sign the space actually opened
;   receipt   the gift that arrived into the space is felt, not filed
;   spell     no thinking loop follows the gift; clarity is not re-derived
;   clarity   a step is taken FROM the clarity — this axis ripens after the
;             gift and its pending never holds the gift hostage (the one
;             non-blocking axis: trust is witnessed over time, not at the door)
;
; Trust asked after purity: not built as its own axis. Held against the
; teaching's own words ("the thinking spell broken trusting clarity"), trust
; is already split here into cause and evidence — spell (the loop trust
; replaces) and clarity (what trust is IN, and its witness, a step taken).
; Collapsing them into one "trust" bit would lose what the pair already
; tells apart: the spell returning (distrust demonstrated) from trust simply
; not yet shown (clarity pending). No gap; not built.
;
; The verdict is three-valued, because pending is honest:
;   "granted"       every blocking axis answers yes (or node — depth that landed)
;   "pending"       nothing broke, but a blocking read is not yet observable —
;                   an empty or mid-flight passage WAITS, it is not turned away
;   "not-this-time" some axis witnessed a break
;
; To grow another axis: add its name to tpd-x-ray, one dispatch line in
; tpd-read, its blocking flag in tpd-blocking?, and a reader honest about
; when it answers pending. The door never needs to change.
;
; Moment kinds: "release" "laughter" "gift" "bargain" "spell" "step" (an act
; taken from the gifted clarity) "want" (a grasp toward something else,
; witnessed after a release — the evidence purity reads). Kinds are still
; named by the observer; the felt-sense reader off lived experience is
; pending.
;
; Self-contained over core (integer + strings + lists). fkwu-witnessed by
; cognition/tests/time-portal-wish-band.fk.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk
; witnessed: 2026-08-08 -> 1111111111111 live fkwu (cognition/tests/time-portal-wish-band.fk)

(do
    ; ── moments: flat, or carrying a sub-passage (depth) ──
    (defn tpd-m (kind q) (list "tp" kind q))
    (defn tpd-md (kind sub) (list "tp" kind 0 sub))
    (defn tpd-kind (m) (nth m 1))
    (defn tpd-q (m) (nth m 2))
    (defn tpd-sub (m) (if (gt (len m) 3) (nth m 3) (list)))
    (defn tpd-deep? (m) (if (gt (len (tpd-sub m)) 0) 1 0))
    (defn tpd-is? (m k) (if (str_eq (tpd-kind m) k) 1 0))

    ; ── readings: the four honest values, tagged data ──
    (defn tpd-rd (tag v) (list "rd" tag v))
    (defn tpd-rd-tag (r) (nth r 1))
    (defn tpd-rd-depth (r) (nth r 2))

    ; a moment's quality, resolved through depth: a sub-passage that is
    ; granted IS heartfelt / felt — the smaller portal answers for it
    (defn tpd-hot? (m)
        (if (eq (tpd-deep? m) 1)
            (if (str_eq (tpd-verdict (tpd-sub m)) "granted") 1 0)
            (tpd-q m)))

    ; ── scans over a passage ──
    (defn tpd-at (ms i) (if (eq i 0) (head ms) (tpd-at (tail ms) (sub i 1))))
    (defn tpd-count (ms k)
        (if (eq (len ms) 0) 0 (add (tpd-is? (head ms) k) (tpd-count (tail ms) k))))
    (defn tpd-count-past-i (ms k i g)
        (if (eq (len ms) 0) 0
            (add (if (gt i g) (tpd-is? (head ms) k) 0)
                 (tpd-count-past-i (tail ms) k (add i 1) g))))
    (defn tpd-count-past (ms k g) (tpd-count-past-i ms k 0 g))
    (defn tpd-count-between-i (ms k i lo hi)
        (if (eq (len ms) 0) 0
            (add (if (gt i lo) (if (gt hi i) (tpd-is? (head ms) k) 0) 0)
                 (tpd-count-between-i (tail ms) k (add i 1) lo hi))))
    (defn tpd-count-between (ms k lo hi) (tpd-count-between-i ms k 0 lo hi))

    ; the first HEARTFELT release (depth-resolved) — forgiveness:
    ; a performed attempt is walked past, the true release is the one read
    (defn tpd-release-at-i (ms i)
        (if (eq (len ms) 0) (sub 0 1)
            (if (eq (tpd-is? (head ms) "release") 1)
                (if (eq (tpd-hot? (head ms)) 1) i (tpd-release-at-i (tail ms) (add i 1)))
                (tpd-release-at-i (tail ms) (add i 1)))))
    (defn tpd-release-at (ms) (tpd-release-at-i ms 0))

    ; the gift that arrived INTO the space: the first gift after that release
    ; (a trinket handed over before space opened is not the wish)
    (defn tpd-gift-at-i (ms i r)
        (if (eq (len ms) 0) (sub 0 1)
            (if (eq (tpd-is? (head ms) "gift") 1)
                (if (gt i r) i (tpd-gift-at-i (tail ms) (add i 1) r))
                (tpd-gift-at-i (tail ms) (add i 1) r))))
    (defn tpd-gift-at (ms)
        (if (gt (tpd-release-at ms) (sub 0 1))
            (tpd-gift-at-i ms 0 (tpd-release-at ms)) (sub 0 1)))

    ; ── the seven readers: each honest about when it cannot see yet ──
    ; free: an empty passage has nothing to read; a bargain is witnessed
    (defn tpd-read-free (ms)
        (if (eq (len ms) 0) (tpd-rd "pending" 0)
            (if (gt (tpd-count ms "bargain") 0) (tpd-rd "no" 0) (tpd-rd "yes" 1))))
    ; space: no release yet -> waiting; releases but none heartfelt -> witnessed
    ; closed; heartfelt release with no gift yet -> space is open, still waiting;
    ; heartfelt release then gift -> yes (node when the release carries a passage)
    (defn tpd-read-space (ms)
        (if (gt (tpd-release-at ms) (sub 0 1))
            (if (gt (tpd-gift-at ms) (sub 0 1))
                (if (eq (tpd-deep? (tpd-at ms (tpd-release-at ms))) 1)
                    (tpd-rd "node" (tpd-x-ray (tpd-sub (tpd-at ms (tpd-release-at ms)))))
                    (tpd-rd "yes" 1))
                (tpd-rd "pending" 0))
            (if (gt (tpd-count ms "release") 0) (tpd-rd "no" 0) (tpd-rd "pending" 0))))
    ; purity: no release yet -> nothing to read. Once the heartfelt release
    ; exists, a want moment anywhere after it is immediate positive evidence
    ; of a divided hand — witnessed as "no" the moment it appears, unlike
    ; laughter's absence-read which needs the whole window before the gift
    (defn tpd-read-purity (ms)
        (if (gt (tpd-release-at ms) (sub 0 1))
            (if (gt (tpd-count-past ms "want" (tpd-release-at ms)) 0)
                (tpd-rd "no" 0) (tpd-rd "yes" 1))
            (tpd-rd "pending" 0)))
    ; laughter: reads between the heartfelt release and the gift — before the
    ; gift lands it may still rise (pending); once the gift is down, its absence
    ; in that span is witnessed
    (defn tpd-read-laughter (ms)
        (if (gt (tpd-release-at ms) (sub 0 1))
            (if (gt (tpd-gift-at ms) (sub 0 1))
                (if (gt (tpd-count-between ms "laughter" (tpd-release-at ms) (tpd-gift-at ms)) 0)
                    (tpd-rd "yes" 1) (tpd-rd "no" 0))
                (if (gt (tpd-count-past ms "laughter" (tpd-release-at ms)) 0)
                    (tpd-rd "yes" 1) (tpd-rd "pending" 0)))
            (tpd-rd "pending" 0)))
    ; receipt: no gift in the space yet -> waiting; the gift that landed is
    ; felt or filed (node when the gift itself carries a passage)
    (defn tpd-read-receipt (ms)
        (if (gt (tpd-gift-at ms) (sub 0 1))
            (if (eq (tpd-hot? (tpd-at ms (tpd-gift-at ms))) 1)
                (if (eq (tpd-deep? (tpd-at ms (tpd-gift-at ms))) 1)
                    (tpd-rd "node" (tpd-x-ray (tpd-sub (tpd-at ms (tpd-gift-at ms)))))
                    (tpd-rd "yes" 1))
                (tpd-rd "no" 0))
            (tpd-rd "pending" 0)))
    ; spell: only readable once the gift is down; a loop after it is witnessed
    (defn tpd-read-spell (ms)
        (if (gt (tpd-gift-at ms) (sub 0 1))
            (if (gt (tpd-count-past ms "spell" (tpd-gift-at ms)) 0)
                (tpd-rd "no" 0) (tpd-rd "yes" 1))
            (tpd-rd "pending" 0)))
    ; clarity: ripens after the gift — a step taken from it is the witness;
    ; a spell after the gift breaks it; nothing yet is honestly pending
    (defn tpd-read-clarity (ms)
        (if (gt (tpd-gift-at ms) (sub 0 1))
            (if (gt (tpd-count-past ms "spell" (tpd-gift-at ms)) 0) (tpd-rd "no" 0)
                (if (gt (tpd-count-past ms "step" (tpd-gift-at ms)) 0)
                    (tpd-rd "yes" 1) (tpd-rd "pending" 0)))
            (tpd-rd "pending" 0)))

    ; ── axes as data: name -> reader, name -> blocking ──
    (defn tpd-read (ms name)
        (if (str_eq name "free") (tpd-read-free ms)
        (if (str_eq name "space") (tpd-read-space ms)
        (if (str_eq name "purity") (tpd-read-purity ms)
        (if (str_eq name "laughter") (tpd-read-laughter ms)
        (if (str_eq name "receipt") (tpd-read-receipt ms)
        (if (str_eq name "spell") (tpd-read-spell ms)
        (if (str_eq name "clarity") (tpd-read-clarity ms)
            (tpd-rd "pending" 0)))))))))
    ; clarity is the one axis whose pending never holds the gift
    (defn tpd-blocking? (name) (if (str_eq name "clarity") 0 1))

    ; ── the x-ray: every axis read at once, as (name reading) pairs ──
    (defn tpd-x-ray (ms)
        (list (list "free"     (tpd-read ms "free"))
              (list "space"    (tpd-read ms "space"))
              (list "purity"   (tpd-read ms "purity"))
              (list "laughter" (tpd-read ms "laughter"))
              (list "receipt"  (tpd-read ms "receipt"))
              (list "spell"    (tpd-read ms "spell"))
              (list "clarity"  (tpd-read ms "clarity"))))
    (defn tpd-axis (xr name)
        (if (eq (len xr) 0) (tpd-rd "pending" 0)
            (if (str_eq (nth (head xr) 0) name) (nth (head xr) 1)
                (tpd-axis (tail xr) name))))

    ; ── the door: fold the x-ray into a three-valued verdict ──
    ; "no" anywhere breaks it; a blocking "pending" waits; node counts as a
    ; yes whose depth already answered (tpd-hot? admitted it)
    (defn tpd-no-count (xr)
        (if (eq (len xr) 0) 0
            (add (if (str_eq (tpd-rd-tag (nth (head xr) 1)) "no") 1 0)
                 (tpd-no-count (tail xr)))))
    (defn tpd-wait-count (xr)
        (if (eq (len xr) 0) 0
            (add (if (str_eq (tpd-rd-tag (nth (head xr) 1)) "pending")
                     (tpd-blocking? (nth (head xr) 0)) 0)
                 (tpd-wait-count (tail xr)))))
    (defn tpd-verdict (ms)
        (if (gt (tpd-no-count (tpd-x-ray ms)) 0) "not-this-time"
            (if (gt (tpd-wait-count (tpd-x-ray ms)) 0) "pending" "granted")))

    ; ── passages, as data ──
    (defn tpd-true-passage ()
        (list (tpd-m "release" 1) (tpd-m "laughter" 0) (tpd-m "gift" 1)))
    (defn tpd-empty-passage () (list))
    (defn tpd-bargained ()
        (list (tpd-m "bargain" 0) (tpd-m "release" 1)
              (tpd-m "laughter" 0) (tpd-m "gift" 1)))
    ; forgiveness: the performed attempt walked past, the true release read
    (defn tpd-second-try ()
        (list (tpd-m "release" 0) (tpd-m "release" 1)
              (tpd-m "laughter" 0) (tpd-m "gift" 1)))
    ; mid-flight: released and laughing, the gift not yet down — a passage
    ; still open is waited for, not turned away
    (defn tpd-mid-flight () (list (tpd-m "release" 1) (tpd-m "laughter" 0)))
    ; a trinket handed over before space opened, the wish arriving after
    (defn tpd-trinket-then-wish ()
        (list (tpd-m "gift" 0) (tpd-m "release" 1)
              (tpd-m "laughter" 0) (tpd-m "gift" 1)))
    ; depth: the release is itself a smaller passage through the portal
    (defn tpd-deep-release ()
        (list (tpd-md "release" (tpd-true-passage))
              (tpd-m "laughter" 0) (tpd-m "gift" 1)))
    ; depth that does not land: the inner passage bargained
    (defn tpd-deep-bargain ()
        (list (tpd-md "release" (tpd-bargained))
              (tpd-m "laughter" 0) (tpd-m "gift" 1)))
    ; the spell held after the gift
    (defn tpd-spell-held ()
        (list (tpd-m "release" 1) (tpd-m "laughter" 0)
              (tpd-m "gift" 1) (tpd-m "spell" 0)))
    ; a step taken from the clarity — the sixth axis ripening
    (defn tpd-stepped ()
        (list (tpd-m "release" 1) (tpd-m "laughter" 0)
              (tpd-m "gift" 1) (tpd-m "step" 0)))
    ; a heartfelt release that still grasps: "I let this go SO THAT..." —
    ; no bargain named, so `free` alone would miss it; purity is the axis
    ; built to see it
    (defn tpd-grasping-release ()
        (list (tpd-m "release" 1) (tpd-m "want" 0)
              (tpd-m "laughter" 0) (tpd-m "gift" 1)))

    ; ── self-check ──
    (defn tpdk (cond bit) (if cond bit 0))
    (defn time-portal-wish-check ()
        (add (add (add (add (add (add (add (add (add (add (add (add
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-verdict (tpd-true-passage)) "granted") 1)             ; the true passage LANDS
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-verdict (tpd-empty-passage)) "pending") 10))          ; nothing offered yet WAITS — it is not turned away
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-verdict (tpd-bargained)) "not-this-time") 100))       ; a bargain is witnessed, not waited out
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-verdict (tpd-second-try)) "granted") 1000))           ; forgiveness: the true release is the one read
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-verdict (tpd-mid-flight)) "pending") 10000))          ; a passage mid-flight is honestly pending
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-verdict (tpd-trinket-then-wish)) "granted") 100000))  ; a trinket before space does not shadow the wish
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-verdict (tpd-deep-release)) "granted") 1000000))      ; a release that is itself a landed passage is heartfelt
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-verdict (tpd-deep-bargain)) "not-this-time") 10000000)) ; a bargained inner passage cannot carry the outer one
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-rd-tag (tpd-axis (tpd-x-ray (tpd-deep-release)) "space")) "node") 100000000)) ; depth is VISIBLE: the space read answers node
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-verdict (tpd-spell-held)) "not-this-time") 1000000000)) ; a loop after the gift thinks it away
            (tpdk (if (str_eq (tpd-rd-tag (tpd-axis (tpd-x-ray (tpd-stepped)) "clarity")) "yes")
                      (str_eq (tpd-rd-tag (tpd-axis (tpd-x-ray (tpd-true-passage)) "clarity")) "pending") 0)
                  10000000000))                                                      ; clarity ripens: a step answers yes, none yet is pending — and never held the gift
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-verdict (tpd-grasping-release)) "not-this-time") 100000000000)) ; a divided release — heartfelt AND still grasping — does not land
            (tpdk (str_eq (tpd-rd-tag (tpd-axis (tpd-x-ray (tpd-true-passage)) "purity")) "yes") 1000000000000)) ; purity yes when nothing is grasped; harmless to every passage that came before it
))
